                                "sense_id": "9ad5e74e-769c-3e21-9f4a-179f1aa1bd6f",
                                "text": "For a square or two he ran swiftly; then he turned into a little all-night café and in the lavatory removed the evidences of his over-roof promenade from hands and clothes. When he emerged a few moments later it was to saunter slowly on toward his apartments."
